==Trivia==
[[File:XY Title Card Ash.png|thumb|200px|The title card segment focuses on Ash for this episode]]
* [[Professor Oak's Pokémon Holo Caster]]: {{p|Dedenne}}
* This is the first episode of ''[[Pokémon the Series: XY]]'' in which {{TRT}} does not appear.
* This episode marks the debut of {{an|Bonnie}}'s running gag, in which she tries to find a wife for {{an|Clemont}}.
* This episode marks the first appearance of a number of Pokémon species in the main series after long absences:
** {{p|Gulpin}}, who last appeared in ''[[AG166|Curbing the Crimson Tide!]]'', 364 episodes ago.
** {{p|Farfetch'd}}, who last appeared in ''[[DP145|A Rivalry to Gible On!]]'', 193 episodes ago.
** {{p|Surskit}}, who last appeared in ''[[DP176|Coming Full-Festival Circle!]]'', 162 episodes ago.
** {{p|Gallade}}, who last appeared in ''[[DP177|A Grand Fight for Winning!]]'', 161 episodes ago.
** {{p|Jumpluff}}, who last appeared in ''[[DP182|An Old Family Blend!]]'', 156 episodes ago.
* Music from ''[[M15|Kyurem VS. The Sword of Justice]]'' is used in this episode.
* [https://www.pokemon.com/us/animation/seasons/17/episode-5-a-blustery-santalune-gym-battle/ Pokemon.com] originally referred to this episode as the 15th episode instead of the fifth. This was fixed shortly afterwards.

===Errors===
* As [[Viola]] first approaches {{Ash}} and {{ashfr}}, the wristband on her left hand is missing.
* The pictures in the lobby of the [[Gym]] switch sides between shots.
* {{AP|Pikachu}} seemingly vanishes from the bottom step of the battlefield after Ash places him there.
* In one scene, the triangle near [[Alexa]]'s {{p|Helioptile}}'s nose and eyes is missing.
* When Viola orders her {{p|Vivillon}} to throw {{AP|Fletchling}} to the ground, her extended hand has her thumb placed under her hair.
* When Ash gives {{AP|Pikachu}} a rest, Viola's {{p|Surskit}} isn't on the battlefield.
* When Viola shows photos to Alexa she made after beating Ash from her Gym {{pkmn|battle}}, her right arm is half colored the same way as her shirt.
